@projects
title: PROJECTS
new-page: true

= Projects

- #agriculture_projects
- @agriculture_return


@preserve_estates
title: Issue protections for large productive estates to prevent their disintegration. 
max-visits: 1
tags: agriculture_projects
on-arrival: {!
  Q.instability -= 2; 
  Q.peasants_unrest += 5;
  Q.kulaks_unrest += 2;
  Q.peasants_b -= 2*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.food_production *= 1.05;
  Q.state_land += 1; Q.communal_land += 2; 
  if (Q.gentry_land >= 3) {
    Q.gentry_land -= 3;
  } else {
    Q.peasant_land -= 3;
  }
!}

Protections are established for current large estates, preventing the land from being broken-up and redistributed. Peasants grumble that we are compromising the land reform process, though on the other hand this safeguards part of the food supply.

@establish_communes
title: Establish collective state farms out of confiscated estates. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – We lack the resources. 
tags: agriculture_projects
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; 
  Q.efficacy_agriculture += 0.05; 
  Q.collective_land += 0.05;
  Q.state_land -= 0.05; 
  Q.state_farm_funding += 0.1;
  Q.agriculture_expend += 0.1; 
!}

We establish a number of collective farms out of existing estates, to be overseen by peasant committees.

@encourage_collectivization
title: Encourage peasants to combine their holdings into state farms. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – We lack the resources. 
tags: agriculture_projects
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; 
  Q.collective_land += 0.01;
  Q.peasant_land -= 0.01; 
!}

We initiate a program to encourage collectivization of farms. 

@promote_cooperatives
title: Promote agricultural cooperatives and peasant associations. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – We lack the resources. 
tags: agriculture_projects
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5;
  Q.efficacy_agriculture += 0.05; 
  Q.peasants_strength += 5;
  Q.kulaks_strength += 5;
  Q.cooperative_land += (Q.peasant_land * 0.02); Q.peasant_land *= 0.98; 
  Q.cooperative_credits += 0.1; Q.agriculture_expend += 0.1;
!}

We launch a campaign supporting cooperative purchasing, cultivation, and marketing. 

@experimental_farms
title: Establish experimental farms from state-held properties, in order to test new agricultural methods and train specialists. 
max-visits: 1
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – We lack the resources. 
tags: agriculture_projects
on-arrival: {!
  if (Q.state_land < 0.5) { Q.state_land += 0.5; Q.communal_land -= 0.5; }
  Q.state_farm_funding += 0.1; Q.agriculture_expend += 0.2; 
  Q.ag_productivity *= 1.03; 
!}

A series of experimental farms are established near the capital, where new equipment and techniques can be thoroughly studied. 





@accelerate_land
title: Accelerate land redistribution to peasants. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources – Increase funding and personnel to the redistribution of confiscated estates. 
choose-if: finalefficacy_agriculture >= 0.6 and resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – [?if efficacy_agriculture < 0.8 : We lack the administrative capacity to accelerate further. ?] [?if resources < 1: We lack the funds to implement this. ?]
max-visits: 2
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.instability += 2; 
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 10; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 8; Q.elites_unrest += 5;
  Q.peasants_strength += 10; Q.kulaks_strength += 15; Q.elites_strength -= 2; 
  Q.peasants_b += 5*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.efficacy_agriculture -= 0.2;
  Q.agriculture_expend += 0.5; 
  Q.food_production *= 0.85;
  Q.food_sold *= 0.9; 
  Q.land_reform_progress += 1; 
  if (Q.coalition_government > 0 && Q.lsr_in_gov) Q.coalition_tension -= 0.5; 
!}

We have intensified the land reform process, by devoting additional resources to confiscation and redistribution of confiscated estates. Peasants celebrate our action, though agricultural production and stability temporarily suffer.




